# A member chain as a piece of source: a literal keeps the pieces it spells, so
# what stands here is the chain `$len << xs` and not the number it answers. The
# design layer describes each piece as what that member answers — `int`, `bool`,
# `Any` — which is what lets the file be taken at all.
xs = ListLiteral[10, 20]

__impl__ = ListLiteral[$len << xs, $in << xs << 20, $get_item << xs << 1]
